/'
    Project: SQLite FreeBASIC port

    File: sqlite3_bulk_aggregate_expr.bas

    Purpose:

        Port aggregate-info allocation and expression collection helpers.

    Responsibilities:

        - Add aggregate column and function entries.
        - Persist aggregate metadata while walking expressions.
        - Register aggregate functions and input columns found in an expression.

    This file intentionally does NOT contain:

        - Aggregate bytecode generation or full SELECT planning.
        - Runtime validation of the translated bodies.
'/
/'
